{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905680/extras/bb3c923a7d23863842a629d4a4d41e5e.avif?t=1755168777\" width=1600 height=308 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udfe3 M\u00e9li-M\u00e9lo 4: The Odyssey of Chestnut Cream \ud83d\udfe3</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four friends, a jar of chestnut cream, an unlikely quest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bigflo</strong>, <strong>Oli</strong>, <strong>Mcfly</strong> &amp; <strong>Carlito</strong> are stuck on the set of M\u00e9li-M\u00e9lo, but an essential ingredient has disappeared... chestnut cream!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into an original 2D platformer and help our four heroes recover it, level after level.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Discover several unique levels, full of surprises and references.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Vary the style of play with a change of character at each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Face amazing mini-bosses and overcome unexpected obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Challenge your friends in speedrun mode: who will finish the fastest?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware... behind this theft lies an enemy well known to the four friends... and he's greedier than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddc3 Did you know?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >M\u00e9li-M\u00e9lo is a YouTube video concept created by the duos <strong>Mcfly</strong> &amp; <strong>Carlito</strong> and <strong>Bigflo</strong> &amp; <strong>Oli</strong>, in which they have fun surprising each other in a series of mini-games and happenings straight out of the minds of each member of the quartet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since episode 3, a mysterious jar of chestnut cream has been making an appearance. In episode 4, the surprise is revealed: this jar gives access to a... video game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83c\udf93 A game imagined by Carlito and developed by students at the Gaming Campus school in Lyon.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Une histoire bien boucl\u00e9e","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3905680/03e86a8a47f435ac502f74bdfc8fb3af9d1367c6.jpg"},{"name":"Premi\u00e8re course","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3905680/99b40ee02c52f63830bf50e50a8e019b525bd48a.jpg"},{"name":"Roi des plages","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3905680/e6bf1203f4808555cb3ec0c2284d6d0de7370cd7.jpg"},{"name":"Star en coulisses","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3905680/8b941b57d1461870f8c100baed89beb4c25c7ca4.jpg"},{"name":"Tourn\u00e9e r\u00e9ussie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3905680/1444bb2d731b98c9f32ddf332d17f6e448b4ae09.jpg"},{"name":"Ma\u00eetre de la ville","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3905680/a67f684b3bc32dc8444924b1d20945237f53a9c6.jpg"},{"name":"Toujours devant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3905680/42413acdfca6150562d894d1f79ddcd4d4bdc21c.jpg"},{"name":"100% pur joueur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3905680/30dc00a1afb130856602548d008dd9c8d956b9dd.jpg"},{"name":"Sprinteur du si\u00e8cle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3905680/98b29a1ce4ca4dae5f9774cc3d12e4d4f6b01068.jpg"},{"name":"Intouchable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3905680/cdc57667d085f5b60bfe4c94a2bb701d29de9bf9.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905680?t=1755168777","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905680?t=1755168777","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905680/b4fe6f00179c59c9cd0a4e1cacbc7491fcb6b715/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755168777","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905680/b4fe6f00179c59c9cd0a4e1cacbc7491fcb6b715/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755168777","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905680/extras/bb3c923a7d23863842a629d4a4d41e5e.avif?t=1755168777\" width=1600 height=308 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udfe3 M\u00e9li-M\u00e9lo 4: The Odyssey of Chestnut Cream \ud83d\udfe3</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four friends, a jar of chestnut cream, an unlikely quest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bigflo</strong>, <strong>Oli</strong>, <strong>Mcfly</strong> &amp; <strong>Carlito</strong> are stuck on the set of M\u00e9li-M\u00e9lo, but an essential ingredient has disappeared... chestnut cream!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into an original 2D platformer and help our four heroes recover it, level after level.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Discover several unique levels, full of surprises and references.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Vary the style of play with a change of character at each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Face amazing mini-bosses and overcome unexpected obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Challenge your friends in speedrun mode: who will finish the fastest?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware... behind this theft lies an enemy well known to the four friends... and he's greedier than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddc3 Did you know?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >M\u00e9li-M\u00e9lo is a YouTube video concept created by the duos <strong>Mcfly</strong> &amp; <strong>Carlito</strong> and <strong>Bigflo</strong> &amp; <strong>Oli</strong>, in which they have fun surprising each other in a series of mini-games and happenings straight out of the minds of each member of the quartet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since episode 3, a mysterious jar of chestnut cream has been making an appearance. In episode 4, the surprise is revealed: this jar gives access to a... video game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83c\udf93 A game imagined by Carlito and developed by students at the Gaming Campus school in Lyon.</i></p>","developers":["Gaming Campus"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905680/9a5f8adf7fe6405135febbd41efd91c97e55108f/header.jpg?t=1755168777","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><